```Title: MSBuild Running a Project from a User-Writable Path or Script Host (raw Sysmon events)```
```ATT&CK: T1127.001 | Severity: medium | Sigma id: 1a1222a0-958f-4301-97d6-b4916793c323```
```Data source: Sysmon EventCode 1 (Splunk Add-on for Sysmon). Change index to where your Sysmon data lives.```
```False positives: Build agents and developers building projects from temp folders```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity medium.```
index=sysmon source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
(Image="*\\MSBuild.exe" CommandLine IN ("*\\AppData\\*", "*\\Temp\\*", "*\\Users\\Public\\*", "*\\ProgramData\\*") OR ParentImage IN ("*\\wscript.exe", "*\\cscript.exe", "*\\mshta.exe", "*\\winword.exe", "*\\excel.exe", "*\\powerpnt.exe", "*\\outlook.exe"))
| table _time host User ParentImage Image CommandLine
